 "description": "Items below their minimum in your own system, least days of cover first, with what is already inbound and the usual vendor and last price. Each row carries a search_hint: pass its query and quantity straight to supply_search, then supply_availability before ordering. Optional location scopes to one warehouse. Needs inventory permission.",
